# Godot 4 editor/import cache
.godot/
.import/

# Builds. export_presets.cfg is deliberately NOT ignored: CI exports the web build from
# it, so an ignored preset would mean the deploy job has no preset to use.
export/
build/
*.pck
*.zip
*.dmg
*.exe

# Test output
reports/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.log

# Security audit reports. `/security-audit` writes SECURITY-AUDIT-<date>.md to the project
# root, and a findings list is exactly the document a public repo should not carry: it names
# the weak spots in one place, and it goes stale the moment anything it describes is fixed.
# Ignored rather than deleted, so a pass can be re-read while it is being acted on.
SECURITY-AUDIT-*.md
